 "Note: The references provided are credible sources that substantiate the statement."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 627, "end": 816, "text": "The ORCID profile serves as primary evidence that Lung Kwang Pan attended Georgia Tech, while the Georgia Institute of Technology's website provides additional context about the university."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 817, "end": 931, "text": "However, I would like to note that this entry is quite minimal and may not meet Wikipedia's notability guidelines."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 932, "end": 1060, "text": "Typically, Wikipedia entries require more substantial evidence and information about the subject's life, work, and achievements."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 7, "end": 142, "text": "Sophia Patel pored over the dusty archives of the university's library, she stumbled upon a faded photograph that caught her attention."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 143, "end": 225, "text": "It was an old group shot of the Wayne State University's Physics Club, circa 1995."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 226, "end": 297, "text": "Amidst the sea of unfamiliar faces, one name stood out: Lung Kwang Pan."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 298, "end": 399, "text": "Sophia's eyes widened as she recognized the name from her research on cutting-edge materials science."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 400, "end": 532, "text": "The same Lung Kwang Pan, renowned for his groundbreaking work on nanomaterials, had walked the very same campus she now called home."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 533, "end": 603, "text": "Sophia's curiosity got the better of her, and she began to dig deeper."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 604, "end": 642, "text": "She tracked down an old professor, Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 643, "end": 703, "text": "Henry Lee, who had taught at Wayne State during the mid-90s."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 704, "end": 751, "text": "Over a cup of coffee in the faculty lounge, Dr."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 752, "end": 817, "text": "Lee regaled Sophia with stories of Lung's time at the university."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 818, "end": 859, "text": "\"He was a quiet, unassuming student,\" Dr."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 860, "end": 908, "text": "Lee recalled, \"but his intellect was undeniable."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 909, "end": 1055, "text": "He would often stay behind after lectures, peppering me with questions that would leave even the most seasoned professors scratching their heads.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1056, "end": 1224, "text": "As Sophia listened, she imagined Lung Kwang Pan, a young man with an insatiable thirst for knowledge, pouring over textbooks in the very same library where she now sat."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1225, "end": 1378, "text": "She pictured him strolling along the Detroit River, the city's industrial landscape a stark contrast to the futuristic materials he would one day create."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1379, "end": 1382, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1383, "end": 1457, "text": "Lee continued, \"I remember when Lung presented his thesis on quantum dots."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1458, "end": 1506, "text": "The entire department was abuzz with excitement."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1507, "end": 1553, 